⟪(c)⟫ morally: ⟦Ephesians 5:5|Eph 5:5⟧, ⟦Revelation 17:4|Re 17:4⟧; c. πνεῦμα, as always in Gosp., ⟦Matthew 10:1|Mt 10:1⟧ ⟦Matthew 12:43|12:43⟧, ⟦Mark 1:23|Mk 1:23⟧, ⟦Mark 1:26|26⟧, ⟦Mark 1:27|27⟧ ⟦Mark 3:11|3:11⟧, ⟦Mark 3:30|30⟧ ⟦Mark 5:2|5:2⟧, ⟦Mark 5:8|8⟧, ⟦Mark 5:13|13⟧ ⟦Mark 6:7|6:7⟧ ⟦Mark 7:25|7:25⟧ ⟦Mark 9:25|9:25⟧, ⟦Luke 4:33|Lk 4:33⟧, ⟦Luke 4:36|36⟧ ⟦Luke 6:18|6:18⟧ ⟦Luke 8:29|8:29⟧ ⟦Luke 9:42|9:42⟧ ⟦Luke 11:24|11:24⟧, ⟦Acts 5:16|Ac 5:16⟧ ⟦Acts 8:7|8:7⟧, ⟦Revelation 16:13|Re 16:13⟧ (cf. Cremer, 320).†
